Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.77,0:01:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.77,0:01:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妮卡 有人在敲门 - 我正忙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nica. There's somebody at the door. - I'm busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 快开门去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.99,0:01:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.95,0:01:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么呢 那么重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing that's so important?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在玩纸牌呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was playing solitaire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 电脑上那些东西都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The computer cheats, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我早就习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'm used to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·皮尔斯女士的快递\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a delivery for Mrs. Sarah Pierce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来签收吧 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll sign for it. - Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉你不像结过婚的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you don't look like a Mrs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.81,0:01:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我 这是给我妈妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not. It's for my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 我也正准备搬回去和我妈妈住呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. I'm back living with my mother, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:01:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是个噩梦 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a fucking nightmare, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.16,0:02:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我见过你 - 见过我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you. - You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 城市大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. It was City College.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,心理系的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Psych Department, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那你什么时候毕业的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when'd you graduate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 我没有完成我的论文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't. I never completed my thesis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.89,0:02:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么课题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,「成功的渴望」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Completion anxiety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为只有男生会那样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought only guys got that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你妈妈现在在家里了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is your mom home now or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.62,0:02:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, see you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.87,0:02:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚才他是在和我搭讪？ - 宝贝儿 你真是太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was that guy hitting on me? - Baby, you're beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 不过我还是觉得他在和我搭讪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. But I think that guy was hitting on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:03:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许我该追出去问问 - 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe I should go ask him out. - Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.68,0:03:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是看起来还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just being nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.89,0:03:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我只是不想看到你受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, I just don't ever want to see you get hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.99,0:03:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你应该抛弃这家庭购物网\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you swore off the Home Shopping Network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几周我没有买过任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't bought anything in three weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你有个神秘的追求者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you have a secret admirer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这听着像是威胁 - 不 绝对没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sound threatened. - No. Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想看到你受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wouldn't want to see you get hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's it from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没注明\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是谁的恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be some kind of joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不明白 - 我也不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't get it. - Neither do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是就是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是恰吉 想来玩么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Chucky. Wanna play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝会喜欢他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice will love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才去录制了家庭主妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I DVR'd Real Housewives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等下再去做金枪鱼三明治 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to make tuna melts later. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.37,0:05:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.10,0:06:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.30,0:06:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.73,0:06:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一辆救护车 马上 是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need an ambulance right away. It's my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道 这里有太多血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't know. There's so much blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:27.59,Title,0,0,0,0,,《鬼娃回魂6：鬼娃的诅咒》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.15,0:09:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本来好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她吃过药以后 又开始画画了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was taking her meds, she was painting again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.37,0:09:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 - 她本来好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No. - She was fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.67,0:09:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么会这样 芭比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could she do that, Barbie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.17,0:10:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么能这样对她自己呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could she do that to herself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得的弗兰克神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember Father Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你好 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Hello, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于她的逝去我深表遗憾 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so very sorry for your loss, Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姐姐认为我来了或许有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister just thought it might be a good idea for me to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你知道我妈妈和我都很久都没去做礼拜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know my mother and I both left the church a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但上帝不在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not in the eyes of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得和其他人谈谈对我们会好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought it might be nice for us to have someone to talk to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.21,0:10:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拥有彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须为她祈祷 让她被原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to pray for her. To be forgiven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是生病了 你不能责备她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was sick. You can't judge her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会责备她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is judging her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 教会对这样的情况一般这样答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, the church's official response to a situation like this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是去责备 而是去怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not to judge, but to pity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲和我已经得到足够的怜悯了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother and I have had quite enough pity, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该看到事情发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have seen it coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 你不用责怪你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, you cannot blame yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本来就是被你照顾着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was supposed to be taking care of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿 伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey, Ian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥抱一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme a hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是把新的轮椅？ - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that a new chair? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不错哦 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's cool. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是吉尔 我的新的互惠生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Jill, my new au pair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我就是保姆 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm just the nanny. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.55,0:11:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:11:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我很高兴你们能来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I'm glad you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很高兴见到你 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so happy to see you. - Me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.94,0:12:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,外婆去天堂了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Grandma go to heaven?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 亲爱的 她去天堂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sweetie, she did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我有个惊喜给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I have a surprise for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.85,0:12:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 我要去洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, I have to go to the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 吉尔会带你去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Jill will take you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.23,0:12:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带她去 妈咪需要陪妮卡姨妈谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You show her the way. Mommy needs to talk to Aunty Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.03,0:13:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和他们一起去 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm going to go with them. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 你们不能锁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, you don't have to lock the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是或许会有人进来 - 我们不会让任何人进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But somebody might come in. - We won't let anybody in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about you guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我们真的不想看你做自己的事情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, we really don't want to see you do your business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 她给你多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So listen, how much is she paying you again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周400美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}$400 a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这超过了我自己挣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more than I make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.73,0:13:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不过你或许应该考虑改变下事业方向了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe you should consider a career change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我是个伟大的保姆 一周400美金啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'd be a great nanny. $400 a week!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.65,0:13:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 额 不过没有福利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Man. - Yeah, but no benefits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝？ 艾莉丝 打开门 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice? Alice, open the door, honey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 马上打开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice? Alice, open the door right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我吓得半死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He scared me half to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:32.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（「黎明之日」 伤残者的生活辅助）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.03,0:15:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 妈妈把房子留给了我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mom left the house to both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后呢？ - 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该考虑把它卖掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should consider selling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 这地方是不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, this place is fabulous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会离得更近一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so much closer to us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:15:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会更加方便见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd get to see you way more often.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.39,0:16:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿走我们卖掉房子的一半的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with your half of what we could get for the house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以安享余生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be set for the rest of your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不关我的事 这是钱的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about me. This is about money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们一直在辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know we've been struggling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,平面媒体要消亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Print media is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩现在在星巴克工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian's working at Starbucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不得不准备送艾莉丝去公立学校上学\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to have to send Alice to public school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她想去圣布里奇特上学已经想很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she so had her heart set on St. Bridget's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想失去我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to deprive my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都有家住的保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a live-in nanny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 事实上 这是不是真的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, that's not really working out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴波 这也是我的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barb, this is my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.35,0:16:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 我知道这很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, I know this is hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.11,0:16:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你真的认为你能独自拥有这里么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you really think you can manage here all by yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈本来想你来照顾她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom would have wanted you to be taken care of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.74,0:16:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他想要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all she ever wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找到了他 - 他在洗手间里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You found him. - He was in the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我认为外婆是想让你来照顾他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think Grandma would have wanted you to take care of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西被送到这显然是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was obviously sent here by mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该是别人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must belong to someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 你已经有太多这样的娃娃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Alice, you already have too many dolls as it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 不过恰吉会是我朋友直到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but Chucky's my friend till the end!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的觉得这是个很好的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually think it's a really nice gesture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 妮卡姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Aunty Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.48,0:17:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么能比这更糟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the worst that can happen, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢被拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to be hugged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢抱你 恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to hug you, too, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 恰吉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that, Chucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉想知道晚餐吃什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky wants to know what's for dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.39,0:17:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜最好在厨房开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I better get started in the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be silly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是我的客人 你们坐飞机肯定是累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are my guests and you must be exhausted from your flight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在自己家里一样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}please just make yourselves at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克神父 你会留下来吃晚餐的 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Frank, you will stay for dinner, won't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 妮卡 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd love to, Nica. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去准备晚餐吧 6人份\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to make dinner. For six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,7人份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我需要一个打下手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I will need a chef's assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉能作为我的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Chucky can be my assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们开始做饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Let's get cooking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这味道真不错 - 这是牛至\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's really good. - It's the oregano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你吧餐具摆好了么？ - 差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you finish setting the table? - Almost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给小费 - 我们势如破竹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pay the toll. - We're on a roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.01,0:19:30.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（老鼠药）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 亲爱的 别碰它 你能给我拿些纸巾么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, honey, don't touch that. Can you grab me the napkins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年圣诞看中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fancy ones from last Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This smells delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 开吃吧 恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Come on, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this, Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段时间你做的很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've really outdone yourself this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to sit right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴波 过来坐我旁边 - 好吧 如果你坚持的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Barb, sit next to me here. - Okay. If you insist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.01,0:20:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看这个 - 谢谢你 吉尔 别客气 请随便坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at this. - Thanks, Jill. Make yourself comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:21:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这么好的瓷器都拿出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought out the nice china.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父 你想做饭前祷告吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, would you like to say grace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.73,0:21:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑我们 求你降福我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless us, oh Lord, and these Thy gifts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.94,0:21:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,并降褔你惠赐的这次晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we are about to receive from Thy bounty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住手 - 向我们的主耶稣基督祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - Through Jesus Christ our Lord we pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.54,0:21:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来一点吗？ - 谢谢你 伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jill? - Thank you, Ian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别介意我喝酒 - 你喝不喝 神父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't mind if I do. - How about you, Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.09,0:21:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 喝水就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.51,0:21:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.10,0:21:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸想先说个敬酒词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daddy would like to make a toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.77,0:21:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬这位厨师\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the chef.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.82,0:21:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 我可是有一个好助手呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I had a great assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.94,0:21:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢吃辣的 - 你真的爱吃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love chili. - Do you really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:21:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 我也是 我可喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Me, too. Love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里面带肉吗？ - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there meat in this? - No. Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是素食\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's vegetarian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.85,0:22:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.06,0:22:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.23,0:22:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is amazing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.15,0:22:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我简直不敢相信这里面居然没肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I can't believe there's no meat in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.15,0:22:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这顿饭太丰盛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so hearty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为里面有牛至叶粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the oregano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.53,0:22:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈以前就是这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just the way my mama used to make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 可以帮忙把盐递过来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, could you pass me the salt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.87,0:22:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.63,0:22:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知为什么 这个玩偶看起来挺眼熟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that doll, it looks really familiar somehow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:22:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父 别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.72,0:22:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好人娃娃在八十年代风靡一时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Guy dolls were all the rage back in the 80s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.26,0:22:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我哥哥也有一个呢 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My brother even had one. - So did mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.35,0:23:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说真的吗？ - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you serious? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.14,0:23:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像在新闻里见过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to remember seeing them on the news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.61,0:23:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得看见人们大半夜的排队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember seeing people standing in line overnight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.73,0:23:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了抢购到各种娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to get their hands on one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.44,0:23:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们和蓝精灵与卷心菜娃娃摆放在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were right up there with Smurfs and Cabbage Patch Kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.40,0:23:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾莉丝 有什么不对的地方吗？ - 味道感觉很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alice, honey, is something wrong? - It tastes funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.37,0:23:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为牛至叶粉放多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we put too much oregano in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.79,0:24:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 小乖乖 其实没那么糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, sweetheart, it's not that bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.92,0:24:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.15,0:25:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.82,0:25:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 我要离开下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, I'm going to have to be going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.91,0:25:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 神父 你生病了吗？ - 没事 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God, Father, are you ill? - Oh, no, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.75,0:25:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回教堂去赴一个预约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an appointment back at the church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.08,0:25:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 谢谢你 辣椒饭很美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, thank you so much, the chili was delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.42,0:25:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 神父 你没事吧？ - 没事 请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Father, are you? - No, please forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.13,0:25:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想贸然离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to be rude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.17,0:25:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早我们墓地见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you all in the morning at the cemetery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.06,0:25:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.23,0:25:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.61,0:26:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪儿？ - 这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.57,0:26:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事情？ - 车辆失控 车头被撞烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Lost control, hit them head on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.74,0:26:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是因为醉驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably drunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.53,0:26:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不可能 我认识他 我跟他的教区内\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, this isn't right. I know him, I'm in his parish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他已经戒酒了 - 你对此确认吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He doesn't drink anymore. - You sure about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.75,0:26:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的教父\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my sponsor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.09,0:26:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦顿 看到这个后 你就会需要喝一杯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanton, you're going to need a drink after you see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.34,0:26:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.35,0:26:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢铁直接插入了他的身体 他流了好多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steel's got him pinned. He's lost a shitload of blood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.68,0:26:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们却找不到具体位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we just can't tell from where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.44,0:26:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父 你能听到我的声音吗？神父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, can you hear me? Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.44,0:27:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持一会儿 我们现在救你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hang on! We're going to get you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.61,0:27:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们他妈的在等什么？快把这些东西挪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you waiting for? Get this shit off him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.53,0:27:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不了这个决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't make that call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.87,0:27:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他血都快流干了 救他出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's bleeding to death! Get him out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.66,0:27:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 准备好 - 听我倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, set in. - On my count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.83,0:27:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, pull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.50,0:27:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对是一部老片子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an oldie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.92,0:28:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呀 这是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 你好可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - You're so cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.63,0:28:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就叫婴儿肥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called baby fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.97,0:28:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可什么都没说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I didn't say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.43,0:28:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快回去睡觉 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go back to sleep. - Will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.07,0:28:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.82,0:28:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's so happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.58,0:28:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸出了什么事啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.83,0:28:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一年他淹死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drowned that year, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.59,0:28:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在妮卡出生的几个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}couple of weeks before Nica was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.38,0:28:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那以后妈妈就像变了个人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom was never the same after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.32,0:29:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.53,0:29:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 是在芝加哥的邻居吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some neighbor back in Chicago, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.25,0:29:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一个怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a weirdo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.83,0:29:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 小姐 有何贵干？ - 恰吉不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey there, missy, what'cha up to? - Chucky's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.92,0:29:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又来 - 你最后把他放在哪了呀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not again. - Well, where did you leave him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.55,0:29:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有放 是他藏起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't. He's hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.14,0:29:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 睡觉时间到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, time for bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.22,0:29:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忘记刷牙和梳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't forget to brush your teeth and your hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.81,0:29:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那恰吉怎么办？ - 吉尔会去找恰吉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about Chucky? - Jill will go look for Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.98,0:29:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去帮你找 吉尔 - 我们还没看完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll give you a hand, Jill. - We're not done here yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.82,0:29:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他藏在我床下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's hiding under my bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.53,0:29:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们会找到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, we'll find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.80,0:30:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去一下 马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.67,0:30:22.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（没有信号）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.92,0:31:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你没有把它丢在楼下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you didn't leave him downstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.09,0:31:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的没有把他丢下 是他自己藏起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't leave him anywhere. He's hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.89,0:31:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he goes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.85,0:31:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没心情跟你玩这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not in the mood for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.70,0:33:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要我帮忙吗？ - 我他妈真需要一个寻物大队\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Need a hand? - I need a fucking search party!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.79,0:33:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我翻遍了整栋屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have looked over every inch of this house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.12,0:33:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我就是找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't find him anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.80,0:33:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 我一直在想你 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God, I've missed you. - Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.58,0:34:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.38,0:34:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是姐姐希望让你找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she wanted you to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.22,0:34:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我跟她在一起的时间不够多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I haven't been spending enough time with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.72,0:34:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎我一停止工作 我就会一直疲惫不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like if I'm not working, I'm just so tired all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.44,0:34:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命是短暂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is short!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.78,0:34:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们总是那么说吗？ - 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did they always say that? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.45,0:34:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 小人儿 你到底在背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, little man, what else are you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.10,0:34:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我孩子说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}telling my kid behind my back, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.28,0:34:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢被拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to be hugged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.12,0:34:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有呢？ - 想玩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - Wanna play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.91,0:35:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就完了？ - 你好 我叫恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that it? - Hi. I'm Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.88,0:35:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你一辈子的好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm your friend till the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.38,0:35:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句话可是经典\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one's a classic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.05,0:35:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且对各种各样的人都管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it works on so many different levels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.39,0:35:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 八十年代的人都很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the 80s were awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.39,0:35:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找到他了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find him yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.31,0:35:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们找到他啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we found him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.56,0:35:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带他上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.89,0:36:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.86,0:36:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.75,0:36:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.31,0:37:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.85,0:37:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.11,0:37:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 她一在 就有坏事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, with her, it's always something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.99,0:37:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她接受我的帮助 然后就就此对我发脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs my help and then resents me for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.32,0:37:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你才会真心感谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one who really appreciates me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.70,0:37:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.71,0:37:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没钱也一样可以生活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get by without the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.80,0:37:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用把房子卖掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to sell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.63,0:37:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 这可是她的家呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this is her home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.14,0:37:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是一烂摊子 你也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a mess. You can see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.30,0:38:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.85,0:38:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你在这 恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, Chucky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.17,0:38:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找了你好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been looking for you everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.94,0:38:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 想玩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, want to play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.86,0:38:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到你可以这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you could do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.57,0:38:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏时间结束 现在是睡觉时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playtime's over. It's time for bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.36,0:38:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能给我们讲个睡前故事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you read us a bedtime story?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.36,0:38:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡姨妈累了 宝贝 我们得让她休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunty Nica's tired, sweetie. We'll let her rest now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.66,0:38:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不累\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.20,0:38:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是别勉强自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important that you don't overextend yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.88,0:39:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不认为我才有权判断自己是否在勉强吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think I'm the best judge of when I'm overextending myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.01,0:39:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坦白地说 我真不这样认为 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Frankly, no. - Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.48,0:39:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你还没意识到你现在多紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you realize the strain you're under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.98,0:39:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认下你需要帮助又不难的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no shame in admitting that you need help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.11,0:39:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说需要「协助」吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean "assistance."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.78,0:39:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 我是在担心的的心脏 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, I am worried about your heart. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.24,0:39:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,马苏尔医生说过我没事的 巴波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Masur said I was fine, Barb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.12,0:39:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你复发的可能性不可忽视 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're at significant risk of it happening again, you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.46,0:39:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- T5瘫痪者中的百分之十三… - 我懂统计学\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 13% of all T5 paraplegics… - I know the statistics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.25,0:39:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,马苏尔医生说过极端的压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Masur said that extreme stress, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.34,0:39:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕是轻微的刺激都会导致心脏病复发\N{\fnArial\fs30}any kind of even mild shock could bring it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.22,0:39:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚到现在 上帝都明白你已经经历了太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since last night, God knows you've had plenty of both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.89,0:39:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 宝贝 快从上面下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, sweetheart, please come down from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.15,0:39:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然残疾了 巴波 不过我已经不是个孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm disabled, Barb, I am not a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.28,0:39:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以极好地照顾好我自己的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm perfectly capable of taking care of myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.03,0:40:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡姨妈 你出血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunty Nica, you're bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.71,0:40:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 天哪 - 我自己处理 好不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - I got it. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.84,0:40:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像刀割过的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It almost looks like a knife wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.30,0:40:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定是做饭的时候割到了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have cut yourself making dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.34,0:40:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没割到自己 - 疼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't. - Doesn't it hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.64,0:40:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不疼 别担心 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, don't worry, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.60,0:40:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她感觉不到疼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't feel a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.48,0:40:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 快点 现在快去床上睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. Come on. Off to bed now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.73,0:40:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 妮卡姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Aunty Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.28,0:40:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 宝贝 做个好梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, baby. Sweet dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.68,0:41:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我躺下睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I lay me down to sleep, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.35,0:41:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷上帝请保管好我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray the Lord my soul to keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.02,0:41:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果还没醒来就将死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I shall die before I wake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.18,0:41:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷上帝将我的灵魂静静地带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray the Lord my soul to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.52,0:41:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑外婆 妈妈 爸爸 和吉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless Grandma, and Mommy, and Daddy, and Jill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.61,0:41:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其保佑妮卡姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And especially Aunty Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.70,0:41:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不保佑恰吉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Chucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.91,0:41:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他不相信上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says there is no God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.08,0:41:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁说过这话？ - 恰吉说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who said that? - Chucky did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.25,0:41:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说过人生无常 当你死的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that life's a bitch and then you die, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.62,0:41:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,血流地像头被宰的猪一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}bleeding like a stuck pig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.05,0:41:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 这样诅咒是不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice. You know it's not nice to curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.38,0:41:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没诅咒 妈妈 是恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't curse, Mommy. Chucky did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.77,0:41:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我会死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, am I going to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.94,0:41:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 当然不会 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Of course not, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.90,0:41:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,外婆死了 恰吉说我们全部都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma died. And Chucky says we're all going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.20,0:42:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 到底是谁跟你说的这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, who really told you that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.58,0:42:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吉尔吗？ - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was it Jill? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.21,0:42:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你爸吗？ - 不 是恰吉说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was it your daddy? - No, it was Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.51,0:42:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.52,0:42:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们可以跟你一起睡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we sleep in with you tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.03,0:42:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 我们说好的呀 你现在是个大孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, we've talked about this. You're a big girl now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.40,0:42:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是暴风雨罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.32,0:42:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔一会就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jill's going to be in in a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.79,0:42:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有恰吉也要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget Chucky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.57,0:43:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕 恰吉 这仅仅是场暴雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Chucky. It's only a storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.31,0:43:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 谢谢您的来电 你查询的包裹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, thank you for holding. The package…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.10,0:43:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,物证保管处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evidence depository.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.02,0:43:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 信号断断续续\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, you're breaking up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.79,0:43:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说的是「物证保管处」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say "evidence depository"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.95,0:43:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？你还在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello, are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.88,0:44:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, I'm scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.68,0:44:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的不害怕才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.06,0:45:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.65,0:45:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到娃娃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.11,0:45:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她真的喜欢那娃娃 - 恩 她的确喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She sure loves that thing. - Yeah. She sure does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.65,0:45:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过呢 我刚给快递公司打了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know, I just called the delivery company, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.03,0:45:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话里说娃娃是从一个物证保护处寄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they said it was sent from an evidence depository.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.00,0:45:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那种犯罪现场物证？\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in crime scene evidence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.00,0:45:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 可能我听错了 信号不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe I heard them wrong. The connection was bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.21,0:46:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure that's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.84,0:46:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 但仍然不知道到底是谁寄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we still don't know who sent it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.55,0:46:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不关心它是否属于曼森家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if it was the Manson Family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.60,0:46:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何能让孩子开心的东西对我来说都无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything that keeps her this happy is fine by me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.60,0:46:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最近一直很伤心的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been so sad lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.02,0:46:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好去睡觉了 明天还很长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better get to bed. Long day tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.49,0:46:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 - 晚安 吉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night. - Good night, Jill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.10,0:47:18.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（恰吉 娃娃 物证）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.32,0:47:29.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（芝加哥三重杀人案 未侦破）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.26,0:47:32.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（星期四 十二月二十九日 1988年）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.30,0:47:41.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（娃娃受到诅咒吗？ 孩子说是恰吉干的！）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.22,0:47:48.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安迪·巴克利 6岁）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.29,0:47:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪·巴克利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy Barclay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.78,0:48:22.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（视频通话等待接通）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.80,0:48:37.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（连环杀手被枪杀）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.13,0:48:39.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（查尔斯·李·雷死在芝加哥玩具店里）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.01,0:48:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.85,0:49:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她起床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.41,0:49:40.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（查尔斯·李·雷 搜索图片）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.65,0:50:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.53,0:50:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法忍受和她们在一起 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't live with 'em. Period.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.94,0:51:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.86,0:51:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 又停电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - Power's out again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.37,0:51:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去看下艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to go check on Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.04,0:51:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那吉尔呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Jill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.21,0:51:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉尔怎么了？ - 喂 巴波\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about her? - Well, come on, Barb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.59,0:51:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每周花四百块钱让她照顾好我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're paying her $400 a week to take care of our kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.59,0:51:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道还不相信她能自己搞定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think she can handle it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.45,0:51:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 她会怕黑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian, she's afraid of the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.14,0:51:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面是暴风雨 孩子可能需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's storming out. She might need me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.85,0:52:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是 谁需要你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, exactly, might need you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.94,0:52:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.69,0:52:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我不知道我该怎么去想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now I'm not sure what to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.91,0:52:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.46,0:52:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用你恶心的幻想来暗示我 行不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try to implicate me in your sick fantasies, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.92,0:52:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经发现你看待她的方式了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen the way you look at her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.38,0:52:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,同感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ditto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.60,0:52:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 我和保姆没一腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian, I am not sleeping with the nanny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.93,0:52:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不了 你不至于这么蠢 巴波\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course, you couldn't be that stupid, Barb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.27,0:52:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,明知道如果我可以证明你们在乱搞的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing that if I could prove such a thing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.04,0:52:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以轻易地从你身边带走艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could easily take Alice away from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.44,0:52:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我可以找找视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I could just check the footage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.86,0:52:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.08,0:52:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,保姆监视器拍下的视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}The footage from the nanny cam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.99,0:52:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么保姆监视器？ - 今天我藏了一个到娃娃里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What nanny cam? - The one I hid in the doll today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.96,0:53:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想抢走我女儿 你听清楚了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not taking my daughter away from me. Do you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.92,0:53:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你毁掉这个家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not going to let you destroy this family{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.22,0:53:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为你那恶心 偏执的指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of your sick, paranoid accusations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.84,0:53:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 指控我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Tune me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.47,0:53:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让巴波搞定一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Barb take care of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.89,0:53:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你最常干的 对不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you always do anyway, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.73,0:53:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这给人倒咖啡的失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You latte-making loser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.65,0:53:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,取证处有消息没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the word from Forensics?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.61,0:53:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要等化验血液后才能得到答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't know anything for sure till they cook his blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.24,0:53:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你和圣保罗教堂的人谈了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you talk to anyone at St. Paul's yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.49,0:53:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说他一整天呆在皮尔斯家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he was out at the Pierce house all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.33,0:53:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 可能他们家会知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, maybe they'll have some answers for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.67,0:53:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to head out there now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.36,0:54:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.67,0:54:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 我现在没空跟你玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice! I don't have time to play games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.57,0:54:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴波？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.44,0:54:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.24,0:54:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴波 艾莉丝在哪？ - 在玩该死的捉迷藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Barb, where's Alice? - Playing fucking hide and seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.91,0:54:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴波 把他放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barb, put him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.42,0:54:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么毛病？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.54,0:55:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 我知道这听起来很疯狂 不过那个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know that this sounds nuts, but that doll, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.30,0:55:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为有些不干净的东西在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that there's something in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.81,0:55:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你知道这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. You know about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.26,0:55:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我确定 - 你早就知道里面有什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I think that I do. - You know what's in this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.85,0:55:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.51,0:55:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何原来不跟我讲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.64,0:55:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在我正和你说啊 - 你何时发现的这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm trying to tell you. - Wait, wait. When did you find out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.77,0:55:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个很重要？ - 对我来说重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does it matter? - It matters to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.27,0:55:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己的亲妹妹在帮人在抓我的把柄当然重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It matters to me that my own sister is out to get me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.07,0:55:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 你没理解 这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no, you don't understand, this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.07,0:55:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好地理解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand perfectly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.82,0:55:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你嫉妒我有个正常人的生活这个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you resent the fact that I actually have a life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.58,0:55:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 巴波 不是这样的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Barb, this isn't about anything that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.47,0:55:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？妮卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what, Nica?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.66,0:55:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的错 好不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't my fault. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.00,0:55:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上发生的事不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you isn't my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.55,0:55:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从学校辍学不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it isn't my fault that you dropped out of school, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.30,0:55:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法离开这个鬼地方不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it isn't my fault that you chose to never leave this goddamned house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.30,0:55:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在等什么 上帝的指示？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the hell were you waiting for, a sign from God?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.72,0:55:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 巴波 把那个该死的娃娃放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Barb! Just put the fucking doll down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.11,0:55:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Nica.{\r}
