Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.71,0:56:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.55,0:56:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.54,0:56:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.72,0:57:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 别碰任何东西 你听见了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, don't touch anything. You hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.54,0:57:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 你现在麻烦大了 小女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, you are in big trouble, young lady!{\r}
