Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.45,0:58:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.91,0:58:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪快对你们感到恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy is just about sick to death of all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.16,0:58:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.20,0:58:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 你现在赶快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, you come out here right this minute.{\r}
