Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.01,1:00:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.43,1:00:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.52,1:01:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she knows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.48,1:01:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.83,1:01:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你眼睛和你妈的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your mother's eyes.{\r}
