Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.34,1:02:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.05,1:03:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.35,1:03:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.27,1:03:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.16,1:03:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian! Ian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.45,1:03:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian! Ian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.17,1:04:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.13,1:04:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊恩 伊恩 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ian! Ian! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.80,1:04:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊恩 他们都死了 - 你在说啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ian, they're dead! - What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.80,1:04:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴波 吉尔 他们都死了 我找不到艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barb, Jill, they're dead, and I can't find Alice!{\r}
