Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.90,1:04:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice! Alice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.53,1:05:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要找到艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go find Alice.{\r}
