Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.36,1:05:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 如果你看到恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian, if you see Chucky, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.77,1:05:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你在做什么 别去管他\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you do, just leave him alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.08,1:05:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰… 你在说啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck… What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.29,1:05:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要离那娃娃远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay away from that doll!{\r}
