Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.68,1:06:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.19,1:06:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.53,1:06:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.82,1:07:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.04,1:07:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.13,1:07:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.76,1:07:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.84,1:07:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 你到底在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, what the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.26,1:07:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他干的 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it! It was him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.93,1:08:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica! Look at me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.01,1:08:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把斧头给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the ax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.10,1:08:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？不 - 快点 把那该死的斧头给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? No! - Now, give me the goddamn ax!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.90,1:08:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊 妮卡 你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Nica, what have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.61,1:08:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 伊恩 求你了 你知道我绝不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian. Ian, please. You know I would never…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.29,1:08:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.88,1:08:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 伊恩 拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian. Ian. Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.30,1:08:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我注射到肋骨下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to inject it under my rib.{\r}
