Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.20,1:09:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊恩 恰吉在哪？ - 你有病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ian, where's Chucky? - You're sick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.28,1:09:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 我对天发誓 我能证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian, I swear to God, I can prove it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.03,1:09:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也能证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so can I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.22,1:09:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 巴波 查看一下这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Barb, check this out.{\r}
