Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.04,1:11:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最好玩的捉迷藏游戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the best game of hide and seek ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.46,1:11:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要闭上你那讨厌的嘴就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep your fucking mouth shut.{\r}
