Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.56,1:12:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.83,1:12:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,该我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.42,1:15:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是查尔斯·李·雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Charles Lee Ray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.47,1:15:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友们都叫我恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends call me Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.26,1:15:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.27,1:15:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你才死了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.77,1:15:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.85,1:15:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的母亲没有给你们提过我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't your mother ever mention me?{\r}
