Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.00,1:16:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, come over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.26,1:16:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我介绍一些人给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna introduce you to someone.{\r}
