Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.14,1:16:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.97,1:16:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就顶在我的胸腔这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right against my rib cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.18,1:16:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快的 很快就不会这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon enough. Cannot come soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.65,1:16:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 这是莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, this is Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.82,1:16:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - How do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.03,1:16:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她的丈夫 丹尼尔 - 嗨 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Her husband, Daniel. - Hello, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.49,1:16:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 丹尼尔 见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Daniel. Nice to meet you.{\r}
