Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.67,1:16:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么美好 快乐的一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a nice, happy family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.30,1:16:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不会持续太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.47,1:17:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢它们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like 'em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.32,1:17:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好看 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're beautiful, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.36,1:17:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们现在很难找的 不在这个季节盛开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Difficult to find right now. They're not exactly in season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.08,1:18:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 我还是喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, enjoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.91,1:18:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gettin' late, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.82,1:18:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去托儿所接芭比了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna go pick up Barbie at day care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.00,1:18:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.75,1:18:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 难道我们不应该留下些单独相处的时间吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, shouldn't we have some time alone together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.72,1:18:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭时间怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about family time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.64,1:18:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.27,1:18:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我只想和你一个人在一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now I want to have you all to myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.10,1:18:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 莎拉 我整天都在陪着你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah. Sarah, you've had me all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.40,1:18:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.66,1:18:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个母亲来说 这样的态度真是自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a selfish fucking attitude for a mother to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.37,1:18:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不想和我一块抚养她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna share me with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.04,1:18:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.05,1:18:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等孩子出生了 会发生什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's gonna happen when the baby comes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.14,1:18:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道也要从我身边带走她？因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna keep her from me, too? Because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.00,1:19:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我来说 实在太残酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would be very hurtful to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.06,1:19:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会看到我受到伤害的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wouldn't wanna see me get hurt, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.78,1:19:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.86,1:19:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不对？ - 不 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you? - No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.99,1:19:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想看到你受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna see you get hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.96,1:19:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想看到任何人受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna see anybody get hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.66,1:19:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.33,1:19:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去接芭比了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get Barbie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.42,1:19:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了 不要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Please, please! Please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.47,1:19:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚 滚啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Fuck! Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.85,1:19:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他们我们的事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told them about us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.19,1:19:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.40,1:19:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.70,1:19:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么想破坏这个家庭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you want to destroy this family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.74,1:20:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你破坏了我的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You destroyed my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.21,1:20:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.05,1:20:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.88,1:20:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是有家庭问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always had a thing for families.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.47,1:20:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.31,1:20:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是关于孩子的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.23,1:20:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你做的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.74,1:20:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 妮卡 是你非要这样对我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Nica, you did this to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.45,1:20:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.92,1:20:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She betrayed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.54,1:20:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,导致我被枪杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got me killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.80,1:20:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道弥补的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I knew a way to come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.10,1:21:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,赐予我力量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.27,1:21:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.29,1:21:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,花费了我25年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me 25 years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.79,1:21:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but believe me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.75,1:21:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种等待是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was worth the wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.05,1:21:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,25年\N{\fnArial\fs30}25 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.10,1:21:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那之后 很多家庭来来往往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since then, a lot of families have come and gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.60,1:21:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利家 金凯德家 提利家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Barclays, the Kincaids, the Tillys, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.40,1:21:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是妮卡 我最钟爱的还是你的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Nica, your family was always my favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.86,1:21:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你是最后一个还活着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, you're the last one standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.70,1:21:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So to speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.67,1:22:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 你让我想起来很多关于安迪·巴克利的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you remind me a lot of Andy Barclay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.67,1:22:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个爱发牢骚的贱货 跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a whiny little bitch, just like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.30,1:22:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他也杀了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill him, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.97,1:22:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这样说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More or less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.35,1:22:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了他的童年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed his childhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.35,1:22:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上是 我25年之前就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the truth is, I killed you 25 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.23,1:22:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是吗 妮卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I, Nica?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.32,1:22:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从未就没活过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.57,1:22:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能把这叫活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't call this living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.20,1:22:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是靠设备在维持生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just been on life support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.08,1:22:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时间拔掉那该死的塞子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to pull the fucking plug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.41,1:22:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你从来就没杀过安迪·巴克利 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you never actually killed Andy Barclay, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.58,1:22:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.88,1:22:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吧 这就是所谓的「成功的渴望」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's called completion anxiety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.21,1:22:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这在男性中很常见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very common in males.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.22,1:22:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是男性 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a male, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.81,1:22:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会慢慢的折磨死你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.61,1:22:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I get that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.40,1:23:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,25年 或许这是历史上最慢性的谋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}25 years. Must be the slowest murder in history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.57,1:23:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 你还在等什么呢？上帝的救赎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what are you waiting for? A sign from God?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.74,1:23:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.93,1:23:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉到了 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel that, don't ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.45,1:23:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩吗 你个混蛋 那我们就玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna play, motherfucker? Let's play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.22,1:25:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police. Open up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.76,1:25:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.59,1:26:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,基于证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on the evidence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.14,1:26:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,被告人已宣称没有法定能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}the defendant is declared legally incompetent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.26,1:26:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,并被无限期押回犯罪精神病院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and remanded indefinitely to a facility for the criminally insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.20,1:27:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着 你这畜生 能听见我说话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alive, you son of a bitch. You hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.50,1:27:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.17,1:27:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.21,1:27:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,请您留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please leave a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.46,1:27:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 是我 我在路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's me. I'm on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.62,1:27:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忘了我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't forget my money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.08,1:28:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们绝不会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.50,1:28:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.30,1:28:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.10,1:28:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.48,1:28:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天的 两天的 还是一晚上呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three-day, two-day, or overnight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.73,1:28:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一晚上吧 实在太紧急了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overnight. It's extremely urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.94,1:28:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,易碎吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fragile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.36,1:28:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprisingly not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.32,1:28:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约价值多少呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approximate value?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.95,1:28:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我妈妈过去常常对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my mother always used to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.56,1:29:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能用金钱去衡量爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't put a price on love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.79,1:29:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是250美元以内了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under 250, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.29,1:29:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给包裹买保险吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to insure the package?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.13,1:29:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that won't be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.38,1:29:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险会保护你和包裹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It protects you and it protects the recipient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.30,1:29:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表示很怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.31,1:29:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,易腐烂货物？活着的动物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perishable goods? Live animal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.48,1:29:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是「其它」物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just put "other."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.20,1:29:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶 我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma, I'm home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.37,1:29:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.66,1:29:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天怎么一样啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are you today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.79,1:29:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm fine. I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.88,1:29:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉幸运吗？ - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Feeling lucky? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.59,1:29:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's great, Bunny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.09,1:29:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你知道的那样 巴尼赢得了17000…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, Bunny has won 17, 000…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.11,1:30:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 你找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, you found me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.44,1:30:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你我会找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.03,1:30:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Grandma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.41,1:30:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the cellar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.07,1:30:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在下面干什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she doing down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.16,1:30:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.54,1:30:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 妈妈和爸爸死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, Mommy and Daddy are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.04,1:30:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡姨妈杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunty Nica killed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.00,1:30:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一直是你的朋友的 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm your friend till the end, Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.84,1:30:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们可以玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's time to play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.05,1:30:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉迷藏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide and seek?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.34,1:30:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,找灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide the soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.55,1:30:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guess what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.89,1:30:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.18,1:30:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么非要是我呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I always have to be it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.98,1:30:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是毋庸置疑的大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're somebody that no one would ever suspect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.90,1:30:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 闭上你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, close your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.41,1:30:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你了 赐予我力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power, I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.07,1:34:48.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（六个月后）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.17,1:34:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你的包裹 - 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Package for you. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.17,1:34:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你赢了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you won something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.71,1:34:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天一定是我的幸运日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be my lucky day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.22,1:34:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩的开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.51,1:35:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. You, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.85,1:35:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 一个座椅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy. A seat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.53,1:35:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要坐在我的脚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your seat off of my feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.37,1:35:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么脚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what feet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.71,1:35:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？嗨 妈妈 你怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Oh, hi, Mom, how you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.54,1:35:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没能给你打电话 真的非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I didn't call. I meant to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.92,1:35:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我一定准时参加你的生日聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm definitely coming for my birthday tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.55,1:35:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 不过不要给我带东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't get me anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.51,1:35:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 妈妈 不要惊喜 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor, Ma, no surprises, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.56,1:35:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我会去的 下午？1点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'll be there, like, noon? 1:00?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.48,1:35:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚饭吃什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you making for dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.36,1:35:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.82,1:35:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Mike doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.57,1:36:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 替我向他问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tell him I said hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.41,1:36:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.96,1:36:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 快点 打开 打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Come on, open up, open up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.29,1:36:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll see you around that time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.88,1:36:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.69,1:36:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩玩这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.40,1:36:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy…{\r}
